# `fonts/` was ignored here until 2026-08-15. It is now TRACKED, deliberately (Tim: "it's harmless
# to publish the fonts if they're open source").
#
# The build scripts were public and their fonts were not, so `scripts/` could be read but not run.
# Both families are freely redistributable and both licences ship beside the binaries in
# `fonts/` — the SIL OFL requires exactly that. See `zp_utils._font_dir`.
#
# Nothing is ignored in this directory any more. The file is kept, rather than deleted, so that the
# reversal is visible to anyone who remembers the old rule and wonders when it changed.
